{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114469","id":3138569708,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc67EsXs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114469","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114469.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114469.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114469","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114469/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114469/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114469/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/971622cae3623a47067c6b55c81c153af666753d","number":114469,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add custom axis sort to CanvasItem","user":{"login":"Morph317","id":128110437,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6LPZQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128110437?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317","html_url":"https://github.com/Morph317","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Morph317/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12405\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n| Original (index sort) |\r\n|-----------------------|\r\n|<img width=\"2163\" height=\"924\" alt=\"f93eaed1d29a51fddc72e86655c44107\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7125f1a-6a7a-4aa8-85cb-b57d6e3e2d7a\" />|\r\n\r\n| Y sort | Custom axis sort |\r\n|--------|-------------------|\r\n|<img width=\"2162\" height=\"923\" alt=\"745da1c4448c5d8c7ff2dfe1229b8c4a\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d799cc1a-28c5-4eb7-9a3f-6e499ceb0fe2\" />|<img width=\"2163\" height=\"923\" alt=\"04a9336e236c03ad54cc856fea7998dd\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42e4e135-2b5a-4fa4-8490-fed999c72bcf\" />|\r\n\r\nAdd axis sort properties to CanvasItem, replacing the original y sort.\r\nDevelopers can now choose:\r\n\r\n- which axis to be sorted first\r\n- whether the sorting is ascending or descending based on axis\r\n\r\nThis can be helpful for making isometric games with various camera angles.\r\n\r\n### Performance Test\r\n| Y sort | Axis sort |\r\n|--------|----------|\r\n|<img width=\"1076\" height=\"403\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bb18f35-a3f2-4a3b-ab67-18891a19cc0d\" />|<img width=\"1077\" height=\"439\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ead28529-5b4f-4695-8035-5863e2c6e95e\" />|\r\n|Around 140ms per process when enabled|Around 120ms per process when enabled|\r\n\r\n### Note\r\n\r\n1. I couldn't figure it out myself how comes that axis sort is running faster. Any help is appreciated to make sure the code is safe (which is probably not at current state.)\r\n2. The current TileMapLayer `x_draw_order_reversed` property can be removed if this pull request is to be merged.\r\n\r\nThe test project I used: https://github.com/Morph317/Axis-Sort-Test-Project-Godot-\r\n\r\n### ToDo\r\n\r\n- [ ] Run more test cases (need help)\r\n- [ ] Make y_sort compatible\r\n- [ ] Remove `x_draw_order_reversed` related code from TileMapLayer\r\n- [ ] Update Document","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_ty